{"id":1848022,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-27T20:16:22.258Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"https://yadinproductions.com/land/","id":1848022,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Land: I Saw and I Didn't See","overview":"Born into a family of influential Zionist thinkers and archaeologists whose work helped shape early Israeli ideology, filmmaker Orly Yadin sets out to examine the foundations of the worldview that defined her upbringing. The film unfolds as a metaphorical archaeological excavation, digging through layers of family history, ideology, and memory to explore how national identity is constructed and transformed when inherited narratives are questioned. Archival home movies, photographs, and newsreels intersect with present-day conversations with Israelis and Palestinians, while animated sequences bring imagined encounters with the filmmaker’s ancestors to life. As the excavation deepens, the film uncovers the blind spots embedded within the national narrative that shaped an entire generation. Ultimately, LAND becomes both a personal reckoning and a broader reflection on how personal and national identities are formed, sustained, and transformed.","popularity":0.0194,"poster_path":"/57oZifMnjqrVgNGrXX5I9r68yBV.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":321496,"logo_path":null,"name":"Yadin Productions","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"","revenue":0,"runtime":112,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Land: I Saw and I Didn't See","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2423317,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Orly Yadin","original_name":"Orly Yadin","popularity":0.0441,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6b08b677e64f42ed2775770f","departmen